Package: spatialGPCA
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Genetic Principal Components from Location-Aggregated Genotypes
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Yihe", "Yang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "yxy1234@case.edu", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6563-3579"))
Description: Fits spatial genetic principal components conditional on location-level
    fixed effects, with a sparse finite-element SPDE model or a local Gaussian
    process. A native C++ engine accumulates full-variant statistics for shared
    smoothing-parameter selection and spatial PCA.
    Prepared PLINK BED inputs are decoded directly in C++ and accumulated
    by location without retaining a complete genotype matrix. An individual
    table supplies identifiers, geographic coordinates and all fixed effects.
    Mesh construction or geographic clustering precedes genotype-based REML
    or GCV smoothing selection.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
